    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.9,
      "text": "When is a platform change appropriate?"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.78,
      "end": 6.68,
      "text": "Replatform means Transition Platform while keeping the decision grounded in workload"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.68,
      "end": 8.54,
      "text": "and target-state evidence."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.54,
      "end": 12.319999999999999,
      "text": "The playbook covers approval, target preparation, migration or transformation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.319999999999999,
      "end": 15.879999999999999,
      "text": "validation, cutover, optimization, measurement, and learning."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.879999999999999,
      "end": 21.66,
      "text": "EMOS does not provision a managed platform or execute a live migration."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.66,
      "end": 27.64,
      "text": "Next, verify compatibility, target constraints, and accountable human approval before"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.64,
      "end": 28.540000000000003,
      "text": "following the plan."
    }
  ],
